  "comparability": {
    "official": "Organizer-computed private-split scores across eight categories. Regular and mixed are different split columns.",
    "local": "This repository uses the labeled public split, estimates localization with 4096 common-score bins and averages lighting groups equally within categories. Its changed-light public Can rows measure different captures from official Can mixed rows.",
    "part_decisions": "Official classification F1 uses any positive submitted mask pixel. The repository default normal-validation image-score rule and its released-model mask rules are documented separately.",
    "model_identity": "Similar or identical submission names do not establish identical implementations or author identity. YL has no linked paper, source or authors in the feed. Highest mixed-average DINO-DDB entries list LIN but no linked paper or source.",
    "original_paper": "The original benchmark paper below-60-percent context uses AU-PRO at FPR 0.30. The paper reports 31.6 percent maximum mean AU-PRO at FPR 0.05 for its evaluated 256px regular private baselines. These historical baselines differ from current leaderboard maxima."
  },
